DTSTART:20261010T190000
DTEND:20261010T190000
UID:678fd71f1193b5463c5cc94a38a21eb8@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Canadian Superfan Matti McLean deep dives into the history of 
 the world&#x27\;s biggest song contest in this award winning remount! Join
  performer and Eurovision Superfan Matti McLean in this award winning remo
 unt of his 2025 hit Fringe show that toured America and Canada in this fun
 draiser for his upcoming UK Fringe tour! Matti McLean (BODIES\, Actual Cha
 os\, $#!t) returns to the stage in the remount of A CANADIAN EXPLAINS EURO
 VISION for the first time since Toronto Fringe 2025. This show combined st
 orytelling\, song\, dance and history in a hyper focus deep dive into the 
 history\, legacy and controversy of the World&#x27\;s Biggest Song Contest
 . As Canada prepares to enter into the contest for the first time\, what i
 s it exactly that we are stepping into? Don&#x27\;t miss your chance to ca
 tch this award winning production for one last time before it départs to 
 Eurovision shores! ‍
LOCATION:Sweet Action Theatre Company\, 180 Shaw St\, #106
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/a-canadian-explains-eurovision-to-other-ca
 nadians-2026-version
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
