DESCRIPTION:Our most anticipated Halloween event of the year is back! Bloo
 dsuckers retuns! Queer Mingle invites you to Blood Suckers! 🧛🏽‍♂
 ️ Get ready for a spine-chilling night on October 16th as we transform G
 eary Avenue Warehouse into the ultimate Halloween party. This is our third
  annual event\, and it&#x27\;s going to be bigger\, scarier\, and more thr
 illing than ever before. Grab your ghouls\, sharpen your fangs\, and join 
 us for a night of dancing\, chilling\, and mingling with fellow creatures 
 of the night. With a warehouse full of haunting lights and a booming sound
  system\, you&#x27\;ll be moving all night. Need a break? Head upstairs to
  the chill lounge\, where comfy couches an Halloween activities await like
  pumpkin decorating and bracelet making (while supplies last). Costume con
 test! Comes dressed to impress show us what you got\, solo\, couples and g
 roup costumes allowed. Enter night of for a chance to win $100 cash prize!
  Live beats by DJ Keysh &amp\; Introspkt Who&#x27\;s ready to mingle? Date
