DESCRIPTION:Queer Cocktail Night - Halloween edition. Mask and costumes ar
 e highly encouraged\, who&#x27\;s ready to mingle! Drink up\, witches! Que
 er Mingle invites you to a spooky evening at The Drake Hotel! Join us for 
 our Halloween edition of Queer Cocktail Night. Feeling the spooky spirit? 
 Masks and costumes are encouraged! Come after work &amp\; grab a cocktail\
 , play some games\, and queer mingle with us 💖 We’re kicking things o
 ff with Social Bingo\, our fav icebreaker for anyone who wants an excuse t
 o say hi and meet someone new! And if you want to make your intentions a l
 ittle easier to read\, grab a colour-coded wristband: 🔴 Taken 🟡 It
 ’s complicated\, but open to flirting 🟢 Single &amp\; ready to (queer
 ) mingle 🟠 Poly &amp\; looking to explore 🔵 Here to make friends Com
 e for one drink\, leave with five friends. Your next group chat starts her
 e 🫶 📍 The Drake Hotel - Lobby Bar 🗓️ Thursday\, September 17 
 ⏰ 7:00pm–11:00pm 🎟 Early Bird: $10! $15 online | $20 cash at the do
 or Only a limited number of tickets available! Link in bio Theme: Masquera
 de Who&#x27\;s ready to mingle? ♿ Venue access: No stairs required to en
 ter the event space. Single-stall\, gender-neutral washrooms are available
 . 🩷 Sapphic-centred event • Please be mindful of the space you take u
 p and help centre BIPOC and trans sapphics. ‍
LOCATION:The Drake Hotel\, 1150 Queen St West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-cocktail-night---halloween-edition
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
