 er if you dare… 🩸🎃 SCREAM QUEENS! 🎃🩸 A Halloween Night for t
 he Wicked &amp\; Queer The moon is high. The lights are low. And something
  wicked is waiting behind the door… 🕷️ This Halloween\, House Of La
 mbda summons Toronto’s sapphic and queer crowd for a night of darkness\,
  temptation\, costumes\, and supernatural energy. Step into a haunted worl
 d of witches\, vampires\, scream queens\, and queer misfits where the danc
 e floor comes alive and the night only gets darker. Expect live erotic per
 formances\, VIP dances\, Halloween games &amp\; giveaways\, bottle service
 \, food\, and plenty of surprises lurking in the shadows. 🖤 Come dresse
 d as your darkest fantasy\, favorite horror icon. Come sexy\, slutty\, spo
 oky\, or all three. House of Lambda invite you to an exclusive $trip club 
 experience created for and by queer people .Welcome to the House Of Lambda
 \, where safety\, solidarity\, and celebration reign supreme. We are carvi
 ng out a sanctuary in Toronto’s vibrant queer community. Pioneers of Tor
 onto’a very first queer strip event\, were no strangers to breaking boun
 daries and creating groundbreaking experiences. These events are all 19+. 
 House Of Lambda is a $trip Club experience for sapphic/queer people only. 
 As attendees please be prepared to tip the dancers/bar staff like any regu
 lar $trip club establishment and to show your appreciation for their servi
 ce! No cis men will be allowed in upon entry. So come join us for a night 
 of fun and excitement at the House Of Lambda. Get ready to experience a un
 ique blend of queer entertainment\, queer culture\, erotic and uncensored 
 live queer entertainment\, music and good vibes. This in-person event prom
 ises to be a memorable one\, filled with surprises and great company🫶
 🏼 Things To Consider! 🚨🚨🚨 This event is for women\, non-binary
 \, two-spirited\, trans babes only! 🚫No cis-men are permitted entry! 
 🚫 We have a zero tolerance policy for homophobia\, transphobia\, racism
 \, harassment or violence of any kind. This event is a safe\, sex positive
  space for all who identify as lesbian\, women\, trans women\, and non-bin
 ary folks under the trans-feminine spectrum. 🎟️There will be tickets 
 available at the door for purchase for $30. We do recommend getting ticket
 s online to ensure your spot\, due to having a capacity at the venue. Onli
 ne tickets are also only $20. Hurry you won’t want to miss this! 📸No 
 cameras\, only memories. In order to provide privacy for you and the dance
 rs we kindly ask to refrain from using your cellphones while inside the cl
 ub. We will have an onsite photographer taking pictures and videos at our 
 photo booth area if you want your pictures taken! 🏧The ATM has a fee of
  10%. If you chose not to use the ATM we have a cash back option which has
  a 20% fee. We recommend coming with cash ahead of time. 💸💸💸 Want
  to make it rain??? We also offer American $1 for sale. 🥵If want to mak
 e it a V.I.P. Experience with your favourite dancers\, we provide private 
 rooms. 🍾 V.I.P. Bottle Service Available: Booth seating with the best v
 iews of the stage Extra attention from the dancers Dedicated server 🍽
 ️ Hungry for a snack\, we have a kitchen with a full menu to choose from
 \, just ask the servers! 🎁 We will have awesome prizes for our games &a
 mp\; giveaway portion that will take place during our intermission. 💵
 🏆 interested in participating for a costume contest \, there will be a 
 cash prize for best costume. Come dressed as your darkest fantasy\, favori
 te horror icon. Come sexy\, slutty\, spooky\, or all three. 💃🪩During
  intermissions from the performances\, we encourage to spend some time wit
 h your favourite dancers in V.I.P. or use the stage as your own personal s
 tage to show off your moves. We will end the night with a dance party with
  our in house DJ!!! Step into a world of indulgence\, mystery and eroticis
 m uncensored performances\, sensual beats\, and unapologetic Sapphic energ
 y. This is not your average night out\, this is a space to celebrate Sapph
 ic pleasure\, community\, and power✨🌈 Come curious. Leave changed! Ta
 g your friends\, grab your tickets\, and don’t miss out on this unforget
 table night! 💋 The costumes are encouraged. The screams are guaranteed.
  ‍
LOCATION:The House of Lancaster\, 1215 Bloor St W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/house-of-lambda-presents-scream-queens
