  filed out. But - what’s that? The lights are blinking back on\, the rid
 es creaking back to life. Who could it be? Well\, it’s the fairies of co
 urse! When everyone else has packed it in for the night\, our favourite fa
 e folk emerge to party all night at the carnival. Join them at the fae fai
 r for an evening of DJs\, dancing\, body painting\, sideshow performance\,
