BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queen Out - Queer and Fem Open Mic Comedy!
DTSTART:20261027T183000
DTEND:20261027T183000
UID:58c60d22629424adc694aebea0496e80@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A special Halloween edition of open mic comedy for the girls\,
  gays\, and theys! Looking for stage time to try out your silly lil jokes?
  Want to hang with other fem and / or queer comedians? Just want to belly 
 laugh and show off your Halloween costume? WELL you are in luck! Join us f
 or an extra special Halloween edition of Queen Out Open Mic Comedy! Costum
 es encouraged (but not mandatory)\, cuz why not? Sign up starts at 6 pm\, 
 with sign up on a first come\, first serve basis. The show starts promptly
  at 6 30 pm\, and will run to approximately 8 30 pm (depending on the numb
 er of sign ups). This mic is open to anyone that identifies as a woman\, f
 em\, and / or member of the 2SLGBTQIA+ community. Sorry cis het dude comic
 s - this one&#x27\;s not for you. You are welcome to perform\, attend as a
 n audience member to support fem and queer comedy\, or both!! The fine pri
 nt: 5 minute sets\, &quot\;warning light&quot\; at 4 minutes Free to atten
 d with no purchase required\, BUT feel free to tip your host\, and please 
 support the amazing venue if you can. There are a range of nonalcoholic an
 d alcoholic beverages for purchase as well as light food The venue is full
 y accessible for mobility aid users including communal and single stall ge
 nder neutral washrooms at-grade All ages welcome but parental / guardian c
 ompany is recommended for younger performers All are welcome to watch / su
 pport this event\, including cisgender heterosexual men\, but performance 
 spaces are open only to fem and / or queer folx We will do our best to get
  everyone up who wants to perform\, but we also need to be out of the venu
 e before our allotted time ends and want to keep the show length manageabl
 e and pleasant. This means we may have to cap or limit the list and / or r
 educe set times if we have more perfomers than expected. Please arrive as 
 early as possible to maximize your chances of getting on. Community guidel
 ines are in place for this show and will be discussed at the top. This inc
 ludes no &quot\;punching down&quot\;\, no &quot\;isms&quot\; or phobias\, 
 and no aggressive crowd work. This mic is hosted and produced by a queer\,
  nonbinary comedian who takes this seriously AF\, and who is committed to 
 keeping the vibes cute and inclusive. If content of a performance isn&#x27
 \;t aligned with the guidelines\, the set will be ended early. We all want
  a sexy\, healthy time! You are totally welcome to wear a mask. If you are
  feeling sick\, please stay home! Questions? Want to come out but are a li
 l nervous? Totally feel free to reach out to the producer Anna Sebastien o
 n Instagram at @annasebastiencomedy - its all about community! ‍
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse\, 967 College Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queen-out---queer-and-fem-open-mic-comedy
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
