 ! The Black &amp\; White Gala returns on November 13\, 2026\, at The Carlu
  in Toronto\, and this year\, we&#x27\;re celebrating In Full Colour! Toge
 ther\, we&#x27\;ll celebrate the vibrant people\, businesses\, and stories
  that have helped define over a decade of community\, leadership\, and imp
 act. Expect an evening of connection\, entertainment\, recognition\, and c
 elebration as we honour the achievements of the queer business community a
 nd look ahead to a bright future\, together. For more information\, visit 
